# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:12
translate italian brandichat11_12a15b04:

    # "I wonder if Brandi is streaming right now. I open up the Kitch website and see her stream on the front page."
    "Mi chiedo se Brandi stia trasmettendo in diretta proprio adesso. Apro il sito di Kitch e vedo la sua diretta in prima pagina."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:16
translate italian brandichat11_10721f64:

    # "She's already in the middle of a conversation when I load up the stream."
    "È già nel bel mezzo di una conversazione quando carico la diretta."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:17
translate italian brandichat11_b8ff41b7:

    # fd "No guys, we went on a for real date! Just me and him."
    fd "No ragazzi, siamo usciti per un vero appuntamento! Solo io e lui."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:18
translate italian brandichat11_1d135968:

    # fd "Sorry I didn't bring you all along with us on this one, but I wanted some alone time, you know?"
    fd "Scusate se questa volta non vi ho portati tutti con noi, ma volevo un po’ di tempo da sola, capite?"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:19
translate italian brandichat11_fb8907cd:

    # fd "I can't just stream every second of my day, as much as I'm sure you want to see that."
    fd "Non posso trasmettere in diretta ogni secondo della mia giornata, per quanto sia sicura che vogliate vederlo."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:22
translate italian brandichat11_707868bc:

    # fd "But we went to the park and had a nice walk. We talked about a lot of things."
    fd "Ma siamo andati al parco e abbiamo fatto una bella passeggiata. Abbiamo parlato di tante cose."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:23
translate italian brandichat11_7e5ded88:

    # fd "I really like him, guys."
    fd "Mi piace davvero tanto, ragazzi."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:24
translate italian brandichat11_49344d1c:

    # fd "Like, I think this is going to get serious."
    fd "Insomma, penso che la cosa diventerà seria."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:25
translate italian brandichat11_67c29154:

    # fd "I didn't think I'd meet anybody that would make me want to get serious, but I'm thinking about him all the time."
    fd "Non pensavo che avrei incontrato qualcuno che mi avrebbe fatto venire voglia di una relazione seria, ma penso a lui in continuazione."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:26
translate italian brandichat11_0d0165ad:

    # fd "I think I might be falling for him."
    fd "Credo di essermi presa una cotta per lui."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:29
translate italian brandichat11_40d00103:

    # fd "Anyways. Dinner's done, stream's over. I should start getting ready for bed."
    fd "Comunque. Ho finito di cenare, lo streaming è finito. Dovrei iniziare a prepararmi per andare a letto."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:30
translate italian brandichat11_4ab06329:

    # fd "No, [pcname] isn't here tonight, but damn I kind of wish he was, if you know what I mean?"
    fd "No, [pcname] stasera non c’è, ma cavolo, in un certo senso vorrei che ci fosse, se capite cosa intendo?"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:31
translate italian brandichat11_c9c25f00:

    # fd "Sigh. Maybe soon."
    fd "Sigh. Magari presto."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:32
translate italian brandichat11_817d358f:

    # fd "Okay guys, thanks for watching! Catch me again next time!"
    fd "Ok ragazzi, grazie per avermi seguito! Ci vediamo alla prossima!"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:34
translate italian brandichat11_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/brandichat 11_1.mp3'
    voice 'voices/brandichat 11_1.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:35
translate italian brandichat11_b92cdc62:

    # fd "Be sure to subscribe and smash that bell icon so you'll be notified every time I go online!"
    fd "Assicuratevi di iscrivervi e di cliccare sull’icona della campana così riceverete una notifica ogni volta che mi collego!"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:37
translate italian brandichat11_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice 'voices/brandi_goodnight1.mp3'
    voice 'voices/brandi_goodnight1.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:38
translate italian brandichat11_8ef86a70:

    # fd "Good night!"
    fd "Buonanotte!"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:42
translate italian brandichat11_31d20b9f:

    # "With that, she closes the stream."
    "Detto questo, chiude lo streaming."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat11.rpy:43
translate italian brandichat11_c9acb08a:

    # "It seems I made quite an impression on her."
    "Sembra che le abbia fatto una bella impressione."

